holders provision cards directly from the Apple Wallet app. When configured, your app appears in Wallet’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From Apps on Your iPhone"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" section.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sessions approach provides a high-level base class, "},{"code":"WalletExtensionHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", that handles the full extension flow. You subclass it and override a small set of methods.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Prerequisites","text":"Prerequisites","level":3},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In-app provisioning must be working first.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.payment-pass-provisioning"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement must be present on the main app, Non-UI Extension, and UI Extension targets."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A shared keychain access group must be configured (the same ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychainAccessGroup"},{"text":" you passed to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ConfigurationParameters"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]}]},{"text":"Step 1: Create the Non-UI Extension Target","type":"heading","anchor":"Step-1-Create-the-Non-UI-Extension-Target","level":3},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In Xcode, go to "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"File > New > Target","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and select "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Action Extension","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Remove all generated files except "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":"."